<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>第二十四轮 A06：FrontendEdit BAML 门槛</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#101a29;color:#e7edf7;font:16px/1.8 "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}main{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:24px}a{color:#9fd5ff}nav{position:sticky;top:0;background:#172638;padding:12px;z-index:2;display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}pre{overflow:auto;background:#09131f;padding:16px}code{font:13px/1.7 Consolas,monospace}table{border-collapse:collapse;display:block;overflow:auto}td,th{border:1px solid #45617e;padding:8px 12px}blockquote{border-left:4px solid #e7b667;margin:18px 0;padding:1px 16px;background:#203249}h1,h2,h3,h4{scroll-margin-top:85px}img{max-width:100%}.meta{font-size:12px;color:#a9bfd3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}summary{cursor:pointer}</style><nav><a href="../../../framework-architecture.html">主架构</a><a href="../../main-ui-map.html">逆向核心</a><a href="../index.html">关联文档目录</a><a data-source-download download href="../../../reverse/A06-frontend-gate-batch24.md">下载原始文件</a></nav><main><h1 id="第二十四轮-a06frontendedit-baml-门槛">第二十四轮 A06：FrontendEdit BAML 门槛</h1><p>未发现新增 FrontendEdit/BAML 原始源码、资源或记录结构证据。现有资源仍在偏移 <code>0x1929</code> 报 <code>Unsupported record 0</code>，缺少原始记录长度规则和实际设计面消费者；不实施猜测性 parser。A06.1/A06.2 继续阻塞，实施增量 <code>+0</code>。</p>
